# SkillX Engineering Constitution & System Invariants
1. Institutional Email: Validate `@iba-suk.edu.pk` on all auth endpoints.
2. ACID Token Ledger: All wallet deductions and releases must run inside MongoDB transactions.
3. Single Source of Truth: Always import types/schemas from `packages/shared-contracts`.
4. Physical Campus Handshake: Escrow releases require PIN or QR verification at an IBA meeting hub.
